@startuml
title 10A. Onboarding Management - Prepare New Hire
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #546E7A
  ArrowColor #607D8B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  DiamondBorderColor #546E7A
}
skinparam partition {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #90A4AE
}
|HR Staff|
start
:Create employee onboarding record;
:Assign position, department,
manager, and start date;
:Select onboarding template;
:Assign documents and tasks;

|System|
:Create onboarding checklist;
:Notify employee and task owners;

|Manager|
:Review assigned onboarding tasks;
:Prepare team introduction and equipment;
stop
@enduml
